hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Hamein Abu Nasr Ahmad bin Muhammad bin al-Hasan bin Hamid bin Harun bin Abdul Jabbar al-Bukhari jo Ibn al-Nayaziki ke naam se mashhoor hain ne un par qiraat ke zariye khabar di to unhon ne is ka iqrar kiya, woh Safar san sattar aur teen sau mein Hajj karte hue hamare paas aaye, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abul Khair Ahmad bin Muhammad bin al-Jalil bin Khalid bin Hurais al-Bukhari al-Kirmani al-Abqasi al-Bazzar ne san baees aur teen sau mein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Ismail bin Ibrahim bin al-Mughira bin al-Ahnaf al-Jufi al-Bukhari ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abul Walid ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Shuba ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Walid bin al-Aizar ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Amr al-Shaibani ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: is ghar wale ne hamein hadees bayan ki, aur unhon ne apne haath se Abdullah ke ghar ki taraf ishara kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se poocha: Allah azza wa jalla ko sab se zyada mehboob amal kaun sa hai, Aap ne farmaya: namaz apne waqt par, maine kaha: phir kaun sa, Aap ne farmaya: phir walidain ke saath neki, maine kaha: phir kaun sa, Aap ne farmaya: phir Allah ke raste mein jihad, unhon ne kaha: unhon ne mujh se ye baatein bayan kein, aur agar main zyada poochta to woh mujhe zyada batate."
"2","Hamein Adam ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Shuba ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yala bin Ata ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat karke hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Rab ki raza walid ki raza mein hai, aur Rab ki narazgi walid ki narazgi mein hai."
"3","Hamein Abu Asim ne Bahz bin Hakim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat karke hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: maine kaha: Ya Rasulallah, main sab se zyada kis ke saath neki karun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, maine kaha: main sab se zyada kis ke saath neki karun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, maine kaha: main sab se zyada kis ke saath neki karun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, maine kaha: main sab se zyada kis ke saath neki karun, Aap ne farmaya: apne walid ke saath, phir jo zyada qareeb hai phir jo zyada qareeb hai."
"4","Hamein Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muhammad bin Jafar bin Abi Kathir ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Zaid bin Aslam ne khabar di, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat kiya, un ke paas ek shakhs aaya to us ne kaha: maine ek aurat ko nikah ka paigham diya to us ne mujh se nikah karne se inkar kar diya, aur mere siwa doosre ne use paigham diya to us ne us se nikah karna pasand kiya, to mujhe us par ghairat aayi to maine use qatal kar diya, to kya mere liye tauba hai, unhon ne kaha: tumhari walida zinda hai, us ne kaha: nahin, unhon ne kaha: Allah azza wa jalla ki taraf tauba karo aur jitna ho sake Us ka qurb hasil karo, phir main gaya to maine Ibn Abbas se poocha: aap ne us se us ki walida ki zindagi ke baare mein kyun poocha, to unhon ne kaha: be shak main walida ke saath neki se zyada Allah azza wa jalla ka qurb dilane wala koi amal nahin janta."
"5","Hamein Sulaiman bin Harb ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Wuhaib bin Khalid ne Ibn Shubruma se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Zura se suna, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se riwayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: poocha gaya: Ya Rasulallah sallallahu alaihi wasallam, main sab se zyada kis ke saath neki karun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, unhon ne kaha: phir kaun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, unhon ne kaha: phir kaun, Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath, unhon ne kaha: phir kaun, Aap ne farmaya: apne walid ke saath."
"6","Hamein Bishr bin Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yahya bin Ayyub ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Zura ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se hadees bayan ki, Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas ek shakhs aaya to us ne kaha: aap mujhe kis baat ka hukm dete hain, to Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath neki kar, phir woh lauta to Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath neki kar, phir woh lauta to Aap ne farmaya: apni walida ke saath neki kar, phir woh chauthi baar lauta to Aap ne farmaya: apne walid ke saath neki kar."
"7","Hamein Hajjaj ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hammad jo Ibn Salama hain ne Sulaiman al-Taimi se, unhon ne Saeed al-Qaisi se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: koi Musalman aisa nahin ke us ke Musalman walidain hon aur woh sawab ki niyyat se un ke paas subah kare magar Allah us ke liye do darwaze khol deta hai yani Jannat mein se, aur agar ek ho to ek, aur agar us ne un mein se ek ko naraaz kiya to Allah us se raazi nahin hota hatta ke woh us se raazi ho jaye, kaha gaya: agarche woh dono us par zulm karein, unhon ne kaha: agarche woh dono us par zulm karein."
"8","Hamein Musaddad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ismail bin Ibrahim ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ziyad bin Mikhraq ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Taisala bin Mayyas ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: main Najdaat ke saath tha, to mujh se aise gunah sarzad hue jinhein main kabira gunahon mein se hi samajhta tha, to maine is ka zikr Hazrat Ibn Umar se kiya, unhon ne kaha: woh kya hain, maine kaha: aise aise, unhon ne kaha: ye kabira gunahon mein se nahin hain, woh nau hain: Allah ke saath shirk karna, kisi jaan ko qatal karna, maidan e jang se bhaag jana, paak daaman aurat par tohmat lagana, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana, Masjid mein ilhad karna, aur woh jo logon se nafarmani ka kaam leta hai, aur walidain ka rona jo nafarmani mein se hai, Ibn Umar ne mujh se kaha: kya tum Aag se door bhagte ho aur chahte ho ke Jannat mein dakhil ho, maine kaha: ji Wallah, unhon ne kaha: kya tumhara walid zinda hai, maine kaha: mere paas meri walida hai, unhon ne kaha: pas Wallah agar tum us se narm kalaam karo aur use khana khilao to tum zaroor Jannat mein dakhil hoge jab tak tum kabira gunahon se bachte raho."
"9","Hamein Abu Nuaim ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Allah ke is farman ke baare mein kaha: aur un dono ke liye reham dili se aajizi ka baazu jhuka do, unhon ne kaha: jis cheez ko woh dono pasand karein us se inkar na karo."
"10","Hamein Qabisa ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne Suhail bin Abi Salih se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se hadees bayan ki, Aap ne farmaya: koi beta apne walid ka badla nahin chuka sakta, magar ye ke woh use ghulam paye to use khareed kar aazaad kar de."
"11","Hamein Adam ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Shuba ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Saeed bin Abi Burda ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: maine apne walid ko hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar ko dekha aur ek Yamani shakhs Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha tha, us ne apni walida ko apni peeth ke peeche uthaya hua tha, woh keh raha tha: main us ke liye us ka tabedar unt hun, agar us ki sawariyan ghabra jayein main nahin ghabraunga, phir us ne kaha: Ai Ibn Umar kya aap samajhte hain ke maine us ka badla chuka diya, unhon ne kaha: nahin, ek saans tak bhi nahin, phir Ibn Umar ne tawaf kiya, phir Maqam par aakar do rakatein padhein, phir kaha: Ai Ibn Abi Musa, be shak har do rakatein apne se pehle gunahon ka kaffara ban jati hain."
"12","Hamein Abdullah bin Salih ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Lais ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Khalid bin Yazid ne Saeed bin Abi Hilal se, unhon ne Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Abu Murra jo Aqeel ke aazaad karda ghulam hain se hadees bayan ki, Hazrat Abu Huraira ko Marwan apna naib banata tha, aur woh Zul Hulaifa mein hote the, to un ki walida ek ghar mein hoti thin aur woh doosre mein, unhon ne kaha: phir jab woh bahar nikalne ka irada karte to un ke darwaze par khade hokar kehte: Assalamu alaiki Ya Ummatah wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu, to woh kehtin: wa alaikas salam Ai mere bete wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu, to woh kehte: Allah aap par reham kare jaisa aap ne mujhe bachpan mein paala, to woh kehtin: Allah tum par reham kare jaisa tum ne bade hokar mere saath neki ki, phir jab woh andar dakhil hone ka irada karte to isi tarah karte."
"13","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Saib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aya jo un se hijrat par baiat karna chahta tha, aur apne maan baap ko rota hua chhor aya tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Un dono ki taraf wapas jao aur unhen hansao jaisa tum ne unhen rulaya hai."
"14","Abdur Rahman bin Shaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Fudaik ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, ke Abu Murra jo Umm Hani bint Abi Talib ke maula hain unhon ne unhen khabar di, ke woh Hazrat Abu Huraira ke sath un ki zameen ki taraf jo Aqiq mein hai sawar hue, pas jab woh apni zameen mein dakhil hote to buland tareen aawaz se pukarte: Aye meri ammi, aap par salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkaten hon, to woh kehtin: Aur aap par bhi salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkaten hon, woh kehte: Allah aap par rehem farmaye, aap ne mujhe bachpan mein paala, to woh kehtin: Aye mere bete, aur tumhen bhi Allah behtar jaza de aur tum se raazi ho jaisa tum ne mere burhape mein mere sath neki ki. Musa ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Huraira ka naam Abdullah bin Amr tha."
"15","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jurairi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakra se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen sab se bare kabira gunahon ki khabar na dun, teen martaba, sahaba ne arz kiya: Kyun nahin, ya Rasoolullah, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke sath shirk karna aur walidain ki nafarmani karna, aur Aap baith gaye halanke tek lagaye hue the, khabardar aur jhooti baat kehna, Aap use bar bar dohrate rahe hatta ke main ne kaha: Kash woh khamosh ho jayen."
"16","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne humen khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Warrad se jo Mughira bin Shuba ke katib hain, unhon ne farmaya: Muawiya ne Mughira ko likha: Mujhe woh likh bhejo jo tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai. Warrad ne kaha: Pas unhon ne mujhe imla karwaya aur main ne apne hath se likha: Be shak main ne Aap ko mana karte hue suna hai kasrat se sawal karne se aur maal zaya karne se aur qeel o qaal se."
"17","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne humen khabar di, Qasim bin Abi Bazza se, Abu at-Tufail se, unhon ne farmaya: Hazrat Ali se pucha gaya: Kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne tumhen kisi cheez ke sath khaas kiya hai jis ke sath tamam logon ko khaas nahin kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne humen kisi cheez ke sath khaas nahin kiya jis ke sath tamam logon ko khaas na kiya ho, siwaye us ke jo meri talwar ke miyan mein hai, phir unhon ne ek sahifa nikala, to achanak us mein likha hua tha: Allah lanat farmaye us par jis ne ghairullah ke liye zibah kiya, Allah lanat farmaye us par jis ne zameen ke nishanat churaye, Allah lanat farmaye us par jis ne apne walidain par lanat ki, Allah lanat farmaye us par jis ne kisi muhdith ko panah di."
"18","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin al-Khattab bin Ubaidullah bin Abi Bakra al-Basri ne hum se bayan kiya, main us se Ramla mein mila, unhon ne kaha: Rashid Abu Muhammad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Shahr bin Haushab se, Umm ad-Darda se, Hazrat Abu ad-Darda se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe nau baton ki wasiyat farmayi: Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na thehrana chahe tum kat diye jao ya jala diye jao, aur farz namaz ko jan bujh kar kabhi na chhorna, aur jis ne use jan bujh kar chhora to us se zimma khatm ho gaya, aur sharab kabhi na peena, pas be shak woh har shar ki kunji hai, aur apne walidain ki itaat karna, chahe woh tumhen tumhari duniya se nikalne ka hukm den to un ke liye nikal jao, aur hukmaranon se jhagda na karna chahe tum dekho ke tum hi ho, aur larai ke maidan se na bhagna chahe tum halak ho jao aur tumhare sathi bhag jayen, aur apni gunjaish se apne ghar walon par kharch karna, aur apne ghar walon se apna asa na uthana, aur unhen Allah azza wa jalla ke bare mein darate rehna."
"19","Muhammad bin Kasir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Saib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aya, pas us ne arz kiya: Main hijrat par aap se baiat karne aya hun aur apne maan baap ko rota hua chhor aya hun, Aap ne farmaya: Un dono ki taraf wapas jao, pas unhen hansao jaisa tum ne unhen rulaya hai."
"20","Ali bin al-Jad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne humen khabar di, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu al-Abbas al-Ama se suna, unhon ne Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas jihad ka irada kar ke aya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain, us ne arz kiya: Ji han, to Aap ne farmaya: Pas un dono mein jihad karo."
"21","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhail ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Us ki naak khak alud ho, us ki naak khak alud ho, us ki naak khak alud ho, sahaba ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah kaun, Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne apne walidain ko burhape mein paya ya un mein se ek ko, phir aag mein dakhil hua."
"22","Asbagh bin al-Faraj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne mujhe khabar di, Yahya bin Ayyub se, Zabban bin Faid se, Sahl bin Muaz se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne apne walidain se neki ki us ke liye khushkhabri ho, Allah azza wa jalla us ki umar mein izafa farmaye."
"23","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Husain ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yazid an-Nahwi se, Ikrima se, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, Allah azza wa jalla ke is farman ke bare mein: Jab un mein se ek ya dono tumhare paas burhape ko pahunch jayen to unhen uff tak na kaho se le kar us ke farman jaisa unhon ne mujhe bachpan mein paala tak, to use Baraat wali ayat ne mansukh kar diya: Nabi aur iman lane walon ke liye jaiz nahin ke mushrikeen ke liye bakhshish mange chahe woh qareebi rishtedar hon is ke baad ke un par wazeh ho gaya ke woh jahannami hain."
"24","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak ne hum se bayan kiya, Musab bin Sad se, unhon ne apne walid Hazrat Sad bin Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah tala ki kitab se char ayaten mere bare mein nazil huin: Meri walida ne qasam khai thi ke na khayegi aur na piyegi hatta ke main Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam se juda ho jaun, to Allah azza wa jalla ne nazil farmaya: Aur agar woh dono tum par zor dalen ke tum mere sath us cheez ko shareek thehrao jis ka tumhen koi ilm nahin to un ki itaat na karna aur duniya mein un ke sath bhalai se rehna. Aur dusri yeh ke main ne ek talwar li jo mujhe pasand ayi, to main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, yeh mujhe ata farma dijiye, to nazil hua: Woh aap se anfal ke bare mein puchte hain. Aur tisri yeh ke main bimar hua to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas tashreef laye, to main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, main apna maal taqsim karna chahta hun, to kya main nisf ki wasiyat kar dun, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, to main ne arz kiya: Suluss ki, to Aap khamosh rahe, pas us ke baad suluss jaiz raha. Aur chauthi yeh ke main ne ansar ke ek groh ke sath sharab pi, to un mein se ek shakhs ne oont ke jabre ki haddi se meri naak par mara, to main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aya, to Allah azza wa jalla ne sharab ki hurmat nazil farmayi."
"25","Humein Humaidi ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Ibn Uyaynah ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Hisham bin Urwah ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Asma bint Abi Bakr ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: meri walida mere paas raghbat rakhte hue aayi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane mein to maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha kya main us se silah rahmi karun, Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Ibn Uyaynah ne kaha: phir Allah azza wa jalla ne is bare mein nazil farmaya: Allah tumhein un logon se nahin rokta jinhon ne deen ke bare mein tum se jang nahin ki"
"26","Humein Musa ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Aziz bin Muslim ne hadith bayan ki, Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ek reshmi hulla dekha jo farokht ho raha tha to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, ise kharid lijiye phir ise Juma ke din pehniye aur jab aap ke paas wufood aayen, Aap ne farmaya: ise to wahi pehenta hai jis ka koi hissa nahin, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas is qisam ke kai hulle laye gaye to Aap ne Umar ko ek hulla bhej diya to unhon ne kaha: main ise kaise pehnun jabke aap is ke bare mein jo keh chuke so keh chuke, Aap ne farmaya: maine tumhein ye is liye nahin diya ke tum ise pehno lekin taake tum ise bech do ya kisi ko pehna do, phir Umar ne use Makkah walon mein se apne ek bhai ko bhej diya us ke Islam lane se pehle"
"27","Humein Muhammad bin Kathir ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Sufyan ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Saad bin Ibrahim ne hadith bayan ki, Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: kabira gunahon mein se hai ke aadmi apne walidain ko gali de, to logon ne kaha: wo kaise gali deta hai, Aap ne farmaya: wo kisi aadmi ko gali deta hai phir wo us ke baap aur us ki maa ko gali deta hai"
"28","Humein Muhammad bin Salam ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Makhlad ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Ibn Juraij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Muhammad bin Haris bin Sufyan ko ye dawa karte hue suna ke Urwah bin Iyaz ne use khabar di ke us ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas ko kehte hue suna: Allah Taala ke nazdeek kabira gunahon mein se hai ke aadmi apne walid ko gali dilwane ka sabab bane"
"29","Humein Abdullah bin Yazid ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Uyaynah bin Abdur Rahman ne hadith bayan ki, apne walid se, Abu Bakrah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: koi gunah is se zyada laiq nahin ke us ke karne wale ko saza duniya mein jald de di jaye us saza ke sath jo us ke liye aakhirat mein jama rakhi gayi hai, zulm wa ziyadati aur qata rahmi se badh kar"
"30","Humein Hasan bin Bishr ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Hakam bin Abdul Malik ne hadith bayan ki, Qatadah se, Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: zina aur sharab noshi aur chori ke bare mein tum kya kehte ho, hum ne kaha: Allah aur us ka Rasool zyada janne wale hain, Aap ne farmaya: ye fawahish hain aur in mein saza hai, kya main tumhein sab se bare kabira gunahon ki khabar na dun, Allah azza wa jalla ke sath shirk karna aur walidain ki nafarmani karna, aur Aap tek lagaye hue the phir seedhe ho kar baith gaye aur farmaya: aur jhooti baat"
"31","Humein Musa ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Hammad bin Salama ne hadith bayan ki, Ziyad bin Mikhraq se, Taisalah se, ke us ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: walidain ka rona uqooq aur kabira gunahon mein se hai"
"32","Humein Muaz bin Fazalah ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Hisham ne hadith bayan ki, Yahya se jo Ibn Abi Kathir hain, Abu Jafar se, ke us ne Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: teen duayen qabool ki jati hain, in mein koi shak nahin: mazloom ki dua aur musafir ki dua aur walidain ki dua apni aulad ke khilaf"
"33","Humein Ayyash bin Waleed ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Aala ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hadith bayan ki, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Muhammad bin Shurahbil se jo Bani Abdud Dar ke bhai hain, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: logon mein se koi paida hone wala bachcha jhoole mein nahin bola siwaye Isa ibn Maryam sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke aur Juraij ke sathi ke, kaha gaya: Ay Nabiyullah, Juraij ka sathi kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Juraij apni khanaqah mein rehne wala ek rahib tha, aur gaaye charane wala ek charwaha us ki khanaqah ke neeche aakar rehta tha, aur gaon walon mein se ek aurat us charwahe ke paas aati jati thi, phir ek din us ki walida aayi aur us ne kaha: Ay Juraij, jabke wo namaz padh raha tha, to us ne namaz padhte hue apne dil mein kaha: meri maa aur meri namaz, to us ne apni namaz ko tarjeeh dene ki raye qayam ki, phir us ne dusri martaba use pukara to us ne apne dil mein kaha: meri maa aur meri namaz, to us ne apni namaz ko tarjeeh dene ki raye qayam ki, phir us ne teesri martaba use pukara to us ne kaha: meri maa aur meri namaz, to us ne apni namaz ko tarjeeh dene ki raye qayam ki, phir jab us ne use jawab na diya to us ne kaha: Ay Juraij, Allah tumhein maut na de yahan tak ke tum fahisha aurton ke chehre dekho, phir wo chali gayi, phir badshah ke paas wo aurat layi gayi jabke wo bachcha jan chuki thi, to us ne kaha: ye kis se hai, us ne kaha: Juraij se hai, us ne kaha: kya khanaqah wale se, us ne kaha: Haan, us ne kaha: us ki khanaqah gira do aur use mere paas lao, to unhon ne us ki khanaqah ko kulhadiyon se mara yahan tak ke wo gir gayi, phir unhon ne rassi se us ka hath us ki gardan se bandh diya, phir use lekar chale, phir use fahisha aurton ke paas se guzara to us ne unhein dekha to muskuraya, jabke wo logon mein use dekh rahi thin, to badshah ne kaha: ye kya dawa karti hai, us ne kaha: ye kya dawa karti hai, us ne kaha: ye dawa karti hai ke us ka bachcha tum se hai, us ne kaha: kya tum ye dawa karti ho, us ne kaha: Haan, us ne kaha: ye chhota bachcha kahan hai, logon ne kaha: ye hai us ki god mein, phir wo us ki taraf mutawajjeh hua aur us ne kaha: tumhara baap kaun hai, us ne kaha: gaaye charane wala, badshah ne kaha: kya hum tumhari khanaqah sone ki bana den, us ne kaha: Nahin, us ne kaha: chandi ki, us ne kaha: Nahin, us ne kaha: phir hum use kis cheez ki banayen, us ne kaha: use waisa hi lota do jaisi thi, us ne kaha: phir tum kyun muskuraye the, us ne kaha: ek baat jo maine pehchan li, mujhe meri walida ki baddua lagi, phir us ne unhein khabar di"
"34","Humein Abul Waleed Hisham bin Abdul Malik ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Ikrimah bin Ammar ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Kathir Suhaimi ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: jis kisi Yahudi ya Nasrani ne mere bare mein suna us ne mujh se muhabbat ki, meri walida thin ke main unhein Islam ki dawat deta tha to wo inkar kartin thin, to maine un se kaha phir unhon ne inkar kiya, to main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur maine kaha: un ke liye Allah se dua kijiye, to Aap ne dua ki, phir main un ke paas aaya aur unhon ne apne upar darwaza band kar rakha tha, to unhon ne kaha: Ay Abu Huraira, main Musalman ho gayi hun, phir maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko khabar di aur maine kaha: mere liye aur meri walida ke liye Allah se dua kijiye, to Aap ne farmaya: Ay Allah, tera banda Abu Huraira aur us ki walida, dono ko logon ke nazdeek mehboob bana de"
"35","Humein Abu Nuaim ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdur Rahman bin Ghasil ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Usaid bin Ali bin Ubaid ne khabar di, apne walid se, ke us ne Abu Usaid ko qaum se hadith bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas the to ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, kya mere walidain ke sath husn e sulook ki koi surat un ki maut ke baad baqi hai ke main un se neik sulook karun, Aap ne farmaya: Haan, chaar khaslaten hain: un ke liye dua karna aur un ke liye istighfar karna aur un ke ahd ko pura karna aur un ke dost ki izzat karna aur us rishtedari ko jorna jis ka tumhein koi rishta nahin magar un ki taraf se"
"36","Humein Ahmad bin Yunus ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: humein Abu Bakr ne hadith bayan ki, Asim se, Abu Salih se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: mayyit ka darja us ki maut ke baad buland kiya jata hai, to wo kehta hai: Ay mere Rab, ye kya cheez hai, to kaha jata hai: tumhare bete ne tumhare liye istighfar kiya hai"
"37","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sallam bin Abi Muti ne hum se bayan kiya Ghalib se unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Sireen ne kaha hum ek raat Hazrat Abu Huraira ke paas thay to unhon ne farmaya ae Allah Abu Huraira ko aur meri walida ko aur un dono ke liye maghfirat talab karne wale ko bakhsh de Muhammad ne mujh se kaha pas hum un dono ke liye maghfirat talab karte hain hatta ke hum Abu Huraira ki dua me dakhil ho jayen."
"38","Abul Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ismail bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ala ne mujhe khabar di apne walid se Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jab banda faut ho jata hai to us ka amal us se munqata ho jata hai siwaye teen cheezon ke jariya sadqa ya aisa ilm jis se faida uthaya jaye ya nek beta jo us ke liye dua kare."
"39","Yasara bin Safwan ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya Amr se Ikrima se Hazrat Ibn Abbas se ke ek shakhs ne kaha ae Allah ke Rasool meri walida faut ho gayin aur unhon ne wasiyat nahi ki to kya unhen faida dega ke main un ki taraf se sadqa karun to Aap ne farmaya haan."
"40","Abdullah bin Salih ne kaha Mujh se Lais ne bayan kiya Khalid bin Yazid se Abdullah bin Dinar se Hazrat Ibn Umar se ek dehati safar me mila aur dehati ka walid Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ka dost tha to unhon ne dehati se kaha kya tum falan ke bete nahi ho us ne kaha kyun nahi to Ibn Umar ne us ke liye ek gadhe ka hukm diya jis par woh badal badal kar sawari karte thay aur apni amama apne sar se utara to use de di to un ke sath maujood kuch logon ne kaha kya use do dirham kafi na thay to unhon ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya apne walid ki dosti ki hifazat karo use na kato warna Allah tumhara noor bujha dega."
"41","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Haiwa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Mujh se Abu Usman Walid bin Abil Walid ne bayan kiya Abdullah bin Dinar se Hazrat Ibn Umar se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Aap ne farmaya beshak sab se barh kar neki ye hai ke aadmi apne walid ke doston se sila kare."
"42","Bishr bin Muhammad ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Abdullah ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Abdullah bin Lahiq ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Mujhe Saad bin Ubada Zurqi ne khabar di ke un ke walid ne kaha main Madina ki masjid me Amr bin Usman ke sath baitha tha to hamare paas se Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam guzre apne bhatije ka sahara liye hue to woh majlis se aage nikal gaye phir un ki taraf mutawajjeh hue to un ki taraf wapas aaye to unhon ne farmaya ae Amr bin Usman tum jo chaho do ya teen martaba to qasam us zaat ki jis ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko haqq ke sath mabous farmaya beshak ye Allah azzawajal ki kitab me hai do martaba us se talluq na todo jo tumhare walid se jodta tha warna is sabab se tumhara noor bujha diya jayega."
"43","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdullah ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman ne humein khabar di Muhammad bin Fulan bin Talha se Abu Bakr bin Hazm se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ashaab me se ek shakhs se unhon ne kaha tumhen ye kafi hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya beshak dosti wirasat me muntaqil hoti hai."
"44","Abul Rabi ne Ismail bin Zakariya se unhon ne kaha Hisham bin Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya apne walid se ya kisi aur se ke Hazrat Abu Huraira ne do aadmiyon ko dekha to unhon ne un me se ek se kaha ye tumhara kya lagta hai to us ne kaha mera walid hai to unhon ne farmaya use us ke naam se na pukaro aur us ke aage na chalo aur us se pehle na baitho."
"45","Abdur Rahman bin Shaiba ne kaha Mujhe Yunus bin Yahya bin Nubata ne khabar di Ubaidullah bin Mauhab se Shahr bin Haushab se unhon ne kaha hum Ibn Umar ke sath nikle to Salim ne un se kaha namaz ae Abu Abdur Rahman."
"46","Abu Abdullah yani Bukhari ne kaha Hamare ashaab ne hum se bayan kiya Waki se Sufyan se Abdullah bin Dinar se Hazrat Ibn Umar se unhon ne kaha lekin Abu Hafs Umar ne faisla kar diya."
